 none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Verplicht of keuzevak</span><span class="EOP SCXW114258728 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW114258728 BCX8" paraid="1559698562" paraeid="{42c6268d-4f96-4447-81cc-751bfd054ee7}{2}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 48px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Een andere keuze die je kunt maken is of het programma verplicht is of een keuzevak zal zijn. Kiezen voor een keuzevak heeft het voordeel van een hogere motivatie bij studenten en deelnemers. Dit zorgt voor een actieve betrokkenheid van onderzoekers, studenten, docenten en maatschappelijke partners. Het stellen van toelatingseisen kan verder bijdragen aan het aantrekken van het gewenste studentenprofiel. Omdat </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">transdisciplinair</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> onderwijs wellicht nuttig is voor alle studenten, kan het deel uitmaken van een verplichte les of programma om alle studenten aan te moedigen samen te werken en verschillende perspectieven te bekijken.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW114258728 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW114258728 BCX8" paraid="479216685" paraeid="{42c6268d-4f96-4447-81cc-751bfd054ee7}{12}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 16px 0px 16px 48px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"></span></span><span class="EOP SCXW114258728 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="ListContainerWrapper SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; position: relative;"><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW114258728 BCX8" role="list" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; cursor: text; font-family: verdana; overflow: visible;"><li aria-setsize="-1" data-leveltext="-" data-font="Aptos" data-listid="40" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Aptos&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;-&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1" role="listitem" class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr; display: block; font-size: 16pt; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW114258728 BCX8" paraid="684790096" paraeid="{42c6268d-4f96-4447-81cc-751bfd054ee7}{16}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Bachelor of master</span><span class="EOP SCXW114258728 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW114258728 BCX8" paraid="767977622" paraeid="{42c6268d-4f96-4447-81cc-751bfd054ee7}{22}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 48px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Ook is het belangrijk om te bepalen of het </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">transdisciplinaire</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> onderwijs plaatsvindt in de bachelor- of de masterfase. Hier spelen verschillende motieven mee. </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Transdisciplinair</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> onderwijs in de bachelor biedt mogelijkheden aan studenten om al vroeg in hun studie een breed perspectief en fundamentele vaardigheden te ontwikkelen. Aangeboden in de master, geeft het ze de kans om hun expertise uit te breiden en zich te richten op zeer complexe problemen. In een bachelor programma zal het onderwijs meer inleidend en verkennend zijn, terwijl in het masterprogramma de inhoud complexer en diepgaander is.&nbsp; De keuze om </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">transdisciplinair</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> onderwijs in een bachelor- of masterprogramma op te nemen is dus afhankelijk van de doelstellingen van het programma, de verwachte leeruitkomsten, en de mate van academische en professionele voorbereiding van de studenten.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW114258728 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW114258728 BCX8" paraid="1640214512" paraeid="{42c6268d-4f96-4447-81cc-751bfd054ee7}{40}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 16px 0px 16px 48px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"></span></span><span class="EOP SCXW114258728 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW114258728 BCX8" paraid="744869930" paraeid="{42c6268d-4f96-4447-81cc-751bfd054ee7}{44}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 16px 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Tijdsplanning</span><span class="EOP SCXW114258728 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW114258728 BCX8" paraid="1794107060" paraeid="{42c6268d-4f96-4447-81cc-751bfd054ee7}{50}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 16px 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">Tot slot is h</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">et essentieel dat het gekozen format aansluit bij de voorkeuren van de deelnemers, zoals studenten, onderzoekers, docenten en maatschappelijke partners. Ook is het goed om rekening te houden met de vraag of alle deelnemers tegelijkertijd aanwezig zijn. Dit kan </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">een gelijkwaardige leergemeenschap bevorderen of er ontstaan variaties in de tijdsbesteding van verschillende deelnemers, zoals onderzoekers of maatschappelijke partners. Kortere periodes met alle deelnemers bevorderen een meer gelijkwaardige leergemeenschap, terwijl langere perioden een diepgaandere verkenning van meerdere competenties mogelijk maken.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW114258728 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW114258728 BCX8" paraid="1794107060" paraeid="{42c6268d-4f96-4447-81cc-751bfd054ee7}{50}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 16px 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span class="EOP SCXW114258728 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><br></span></p></div><div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; clear: both; cursor: text; overflow: visible; position: relative; direction: ltr;"><p class="Paragraph SCXW114258728 BCX8" paraid="1811868163" paraeid="{42c6268d-4f96-4447-81cc-751bfd054ee7}{56}" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 16px 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext;"><span data-contrast="none" xml:lang="NL-NL" lang="NL-NL" class="TextRun SCXW114258728 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Bronnen:</span><span class="EOP SCXW114258728 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}"